## Get HLS Playlist Manifest

```http
GET /stream/:id/playlist.m3u8
```

Returns an HLS `.m3u8` playlist manifest referencing audio segment URLs.

### Headers

- `Authorization`: `Bearer <client_api_key>` (or `x-api-key`)

### Response (`200 OK`)

**Content-Type**: `application/vnd.apple.mpegurl`

```http
#EXTM3U
#EXT-X-VERSION:3
#EXT-X-TARGETDURATION:10
#EXT-X-MEDIA-SEQUENCE:0
#EXTINF:10.000,
https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/hls/trk_7f9a2b1c/segment0.ts
#EXTINF:10.000,
https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/hls/trk_7f9a2b1c/segment1.ts
#EXT-X-ENDLIST
```

> [!NOTE]
> Audio segments are hosted directly on Cloudflare R2 object storage (`cdn.lament.rynds.my.id`). Direct unauthorized external hotlinking is blocked at the Cloudflare edge via WAF Referer validation rules.

---

## Stream HLS Segment

```http
GET /hls/:id/:segment
```

Serves raw `.ts` audio segment files directly from Cloudflare R2 object storage.

### Response (`200 OK`)

**Content-Type**: `video/mp2ts` (MPEG-2 Transport Stream audio)
